%!PS
/Courier findfont 22 scalefont setfont
%%Page: 1 1
120 620 moveto (Chapter 1 - Hello FeatherPDF) show
[/Count 2 /Title (Chapter 1) /Dest [1 /Fit] /OUT pdfmark
showpage
%%Page: 2 2
120 500 moveto (Section 1.1 - Invert me) show
120 400 moveto (Visit example.com for more) show
% 超链接注释：指向 https://example.com，矩形覆盖 "example.com" 文字
[/Rect [ 120 395 320 425 ] /Action << /S /URI /URI (https://example.com) >> /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
[/Count 0 /Title (Section 1.1) /Dest [2 /Fit] /OUT pdfmark
showpage
%%Page: 3 3
200 300 moveto (Chapter 2 - Content fit) show
[/Count 0 /Title (Chapter 2) /Dest [3 /Fit] /OUT pdfmark
showpage
